Plans in random order of silliness.

1) Slip off your duds, slip by the rock, and see if the
situation improves when seen from the other side; perhaps
there will be room to nudge the boulder the other direction
and free the co-aligned unicorn to bother someone else.

2) Temporarily abandon Sokoban, go nudge a few dwarfs until
one drops a pickaxe; most Sokoban levels have two spare
boulders.

3) Ditto, go find a wand of digging, strip, squeeze to the
square of the boulder, zap _down_, see if anything nice
happens, like the boulder falling into the hole, as opposed
to the dungeon collapsing. Be prepared to run upstairs in
your skivvies if you go into the hole before or instead of
the boulder.

4) Ditto all, but with taming and a leash, try to charm,
leash the unicorn, first, and take it down with you when you zap.

5) Taming might also let you displace the unicorn, removing
the need for the wand of digging; jump down some other hole
with the leashed unicorn.

